{"title":"🎃👻 HIKERS’ HALLOWEEN PARTY! 👻🎃","startsAt":"2026-11-06T19:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-06T23:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Once a year, we get to be whoever—or whatever—we want! 😈✨\nMasks, costumes, makeup, crazy characters… Halloween is our excuse to step out of everyday life and have some fun!\n\nSo… who do YOU want to be this Halloween? 🧙‍♀️🧛‍♂️🦸‍♀️👻\n\nLet’s gather our hiking crew, put on our wildest costumes, eat, drink, dance, laugh, and party like there’s no tomorrow! 💃🕺🎶\n\n📍 Location: Tehroon 60 Restaurant\n📅 Date: November 6\n⏰ Time: 7:00–11:00 PM\n💰 Entry: $30\n🍹 Includes light dinner\n🍽️ Order your own drink\n\n🎟️ Save your spot: E-transfer $30 to\nmojgan.mn@hotmail.com\n\nAnd remember… the crazier the costume, the better! 🎭😂\n\nCome ready to leave your everyday self at the door and let your Halloween character take over for one night! 🎃🥳\n\nLet’s make this a night to remember! 🥂💃🕺","venue":{"name":"Tehroon 60 restaurant","address":"12963 Yonge st,, Richmond hill","lat":43.94375,"lng":-79.45426,"city":"Richmond hill"},"fee":null,"group":"Forest Footprints","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/4/2/a/highres_535786122.jpeg"}